 "description": "Show one micropage project in detail: live URL, editor URL, the active build (the default publish target), the latest build, the build that is live now, the failure reason if a build failed, and read-only custom-domain status (Cloudflare hostname and certificate state, and the CNAME target).\n\nUse it to check what is live versus drafted before publishing, to explain why a build failed, or to answer \"is my custom domain working?\". Accepts the project's uuid, numeric id, micropage domain (\"acme\" or \"acme.micropage.sh\") or custom domain.\n\nIt does not return the page source (use get_page_source) or follow a deploy in progress (use get_deploy_status), and it cannot change the custom domain; that is done in the micropage editor.",
 "inputSchema": {
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "properties": {
   "project": {
    "description": "Which project: its uuid, its numeric id, its micropage hostname (\"acme\" or \"acme.micropage.sh\") or its custom domain (\"www.acme.com\"). A full URL also works. Get valid values from list_projects.",
    "maxLength": 300,
    "minLength": 1,
    "type": "string"
   }
  },
  "required": [
   "project"
  ],
  "type": "object"
 },
 "name": "get_project",
